WEBVTT

00:01.670 --> 00:03.007
(The tassel crowns the knight.
The sword is snow white.)

00:03.031 --> 00:04.366
(In the silver saddle,
he rides like a shooting star.)

00:04.390 --> 00:07.606
(He kills a man within ten steps.
Invincible he is all the way ahead.)

00:07.630 --> 00:13.190
(He would leave once it's done.
No trace of him is to be found.)

01:26.190 --> 01:31.150
=Sword Snow Stride= (Season 1)

01:31.310 --> 01:34.550
=Episode 12=

01:53.750 --> 01:54.750
There you are, Fengnian.

01:55.425 --> 01:56.425
Come on.

01:56.800 --> 01:57.800
Be seated.

01:59.875 --> 02:01.515
Huangman'er has been sent
to Mount Longhu.

02:02.450 --> 02:03.090
Ah.

02:03.250 --> 02:04.250
I knew that.

02:04.725 --> 02:07.570
I received the letter from Mount Longhu.

02:08.400 --> 02:09.650
Zhao Xituan

02:10.125 --> 02:11.027
is nice to Huangman'er,

02:11.051 --> 02:13.250
treating him as his last disciple.

02:25.650 --> 02:28.130
Old Huang made a deal with Zhao Xituan.

02:29.125 --> 02:30.775
Did you arrange it?

02:31.250 --> 02:32.250
No.

02:32.825 --> 02:34.346
I didn't know

02:34.370 --> 02:35.475
what Old Huang did.

02:48.010 --> 02:49.610
So, in your original plan,

02:50.300 --> 02:51.730
where would Huangman'er be sent to?

02:57.900 --> 02:59.500
You knew the answer,

03:00.025 --> 03:01.290
didn't you?

03:03.300 --> 03:04.726
I think it was quite a coincidence

03:04.750 --> 03:06.900
that Princess Suizhu appeared
in Mount Wudang.

03:13.075 --> 03:15.151
Everyone is wrong about you.

03:15.175 --> 03:16.626
Fengnian, good job.

03:16.650 --> 03:17.650
Clever boy.

03:19.130 --> 03:20.426
So, you were going to

03:20.450 --> 03:21.930
send Huangman'er to the royal family?

03:24.075 --> 03:26.125
His stay in North Liang
would be bad for you.

03:26.975 --> 03:29.425
The royal family only wants him
as a pawn!

03:29.925 --> 03:31.546
When we give Huangman'er to them,

03:31.570 --> 03:33.176
no harm will be done to us.

03:33.200 --> 03:35.126
He's your son!

03:35.150 --> 03:35.827
You...

03:35.851 --> 03:37.900
You're also my son.

03:40.250 --> 03:42.130
All right. All right.

03:42.300 --> 03:44.951
Look. The result

03:44.975 --> 03:46.986
is better than we expected.

03:47.010 --> 03:48.010
Isn't it?

03:49.275 --> 03:51.330
But Old Huang died!

04:27.600 --> 04:29.080
I'm willing to take over North Liang.

04:31.025 --> 04:32.025
Ah?

04:33.100 --> 04:35.650
I'm willing to take over North Liang!

04:37.700 --> 04:38.700
Wait.

04:39.425 --> 04:40.926
You used to reject it.

04:40.950 --> 04:43.250
Why do you suddenly accept it?

04:43.625 --> 04:44.625
Give me a reason.

04:45.875 --> 04:47.600
I can't get Huangman'er back

04:48.225 --> 04:49.950
unless I take over North Liang.

04:51.775 --> 04:52.775
Oh.

04:55.125 --> 04:56.125
Any other reason?

04:57.225 --> 04:58.530
Isn't this enough?

05:02.700 --> 05:03.906
You and your brother are close.

05:03.930 --> 05:05.475
This is good.

05:07.125 --> 05:08.751
But when you want

05:08.775 --> 05:10.730
to be the ruler of three states
in North Liang,

05:10.875 --> 05:12.450
this reason isn't...

05:13.750 --> 05:15.050
You don't agree?

05:15.350 --> 05:16.350
I do!

05:16.425 --> 05:17.307
I do!

05:17.331 --> 05:19.076
I can't be too happy.

05:19.100 --> 05:20.506
I've been waiting for such a long time

05:20.530 --> 05:22.275
and you agreed at last.

05:23.575 --> 05:24.675
The reason isn't enough?

05:25.850 --> 05:26.850
It doesn't matter.

05:27.250 --> 05:28.330
Let me give you a reason.

05:29.575 --> 05:30.770
Seriously?

05:31.950 --> 05:33.701
Since you came back from Wudang Sect,

05:33.725 --> 05:35.485
you haven't visited
your master, have you?

05:36.100 --> 05:37.850
Go tell him you're back.

05:38.075 --> 05:39.450
Wait for me there.

05:39.600 --> 05:40.600
All right?

05:48.875 --> 05:49.667
Go ahead.

05:49.691 --> 05:50.866
I'll be right there.

05:50.890 --> 05:52.425
With the reason for you.

06:47.290 --> 06:48.290
You're back?

06:48.650 --> 06:50.401
I have been in Mount Wudang for days.

06:50.425 --> 06:52.350
Why didn't you ask me how my stay was?

06:52.650 --> 06:54.150
How was your stay there?

06:54.700 --> 06:56.650
You sound quite offhand.

07:02.350 --> 07:03.410
What are you doing?

07:03.725 --> 07:04.810
What's down there?

07:05.350 --> 07:06.350
The foundation.

07:08.550 --> 07:09.377
Wrong.

07:09.401 --> 07:11.490
I tramped hard during my blade practice.

07:11.825 --> 07:13.450
I felt there was some space down here.

07:13.825 --> 07:15.425
There's another floor down here,
I guess.

07:16.300 --> 07:18.426
I've been hanging around
in Tingchao Pavilion since I was little.

07:18.450 --> 07:19.586
If there's a floor down there,

07:19.610 --> 07:20.650
I must be aware.

07:22.525 --> 07:23.626
You don't know?

07:23.650 --> 07:25.200
There isn't anything down there.

07:26.875 --> 07:27.875
What?

07:29.010 --> 07:30.950
Wang Chonglou passed you Dahuangting?

07:31.125 --> 07:32.601
You could still see that?

07:32.625 --> 07:34.150
I thought there was no trace of it.

07:34.525 --> 07:35.525
Don't worry.

07:35.650 --> 07:36.850
Others can't see it.

07:37.250 --> 07:38.050
I just know

07:38.090 --> 07:39.650
about the details of Wudang Heart Arts.

07:40.800 --> 07:42.370
You have a connection with Wudang Sect?

07:42.700 --> 07:43.800
A family connection.

07:46.125 --> 07:48.400
What does your family do?

07:49.450 --> 07:50.650
It's none of your business.

07:54.700 --> 07:55.866
Take your time searching.

07:55.890 --> 07:56.890
I'm going upstairs.

08:02.625 --> 08:03.625
Give my blade back to me.

08:03.650 --> 08:04.725
Xiudong?

08:04.825 --> 08:06.050
I lent it to you.

08:06.575 --> 08:08.025
It's very handy for me.

08:43.525 --> 08:44.276
Master,

08:44.300 --> 08:45.300
I'm back.

08:53.625 --> 08:54.625
Good move.

08:54.700 --> 08:55.825
Hidden intention to kill.

08:58.225 --> 08:59.225
Oh.

09:00.325 --> 09:02.730
I took the wrong move, then.

09:03.025 --> 09:04.170
I'll start a new game.

10:18.550 --> 10:19.550
Master,

10:19.725 --> 10:21.226
you keep playing chess

10:21.250 --> 10:22.775
with yourself in the room.

10:23.100 --> 10:24.100
Don't you feel bored?

10:24.550 --> 10:26.050
I've got an opponent.

10:27.450 --> 10:28.500
Where's he?

10:29.570 --> 10:31.290
Don't ask

10:31.610 --> 10:32.890
until you take over North Liang.

10:39.425 --> 10:41.050
I promised Xu Xiao.

10:42.570 --> 10:43.950
Xu Xiao

10:44.370 --> 10:46.150
asked you to come here?

10:46.600 --> 10:47.600
Yes.

10:48.610 --> 10:49.850
Go downstairs, then.

10:50.300 --> 10:51.850
He'll give you an answer.

11:08.675 --> 11:10.000
A piece of advice for you.

11:10.350 --> 11:11.670
Later,

11:12.275 --> 11:14.550
speak your mind to your father.

11:38.850 --> 11:40.330
How did you find it?

11:41.010 --> 11:42.370
Your father opened the door.

11:51.675 --> 11:52.675
There you are.

11:55.900 --> 11:57.330
What's hidden down there?

11:58.225 --> 11:59.330
You even keep it from me.

12:01.325 --> 12:03.275
Unless you promise
to take over North Liang,

12:03.925 --> 12:04.925
I cannot

12:04.950 --> 12:06.150
take you down there.

12:07.175 --> 12:08.175
Let's go.

12:24.300 --> 12:26.525
What did your master tell you?

12:32.625 --> 12:34.375
He asked me to speak my mind.

12:36.350 --> 12:37.350
He wanted me to tell you

12:38.275 --> 12:39.266
why I've kept refusing
to take over North Liang

12:39.290 --> 12:40.825
over so many years.

12:43.325 --> 12:44.325
Also,

12:48.250 --> 12:49.530
why have I always been angry

12:50.125 --> 12:51.730
with you?

12:52.625 --> 12:53.625
Mm.

12:54.100 --> 12:55.170
I'm all ears.

12:56.550 --> 12:57.690
You know

12:57.975 --> 12:59.875
my eldest sister likes Hong Xixiang.

13:00.775 --> 13:03.186
The young Taoist on Mount Wudang?

13:03.210 --> 13:04.210
I certainly know.

13:04.425 --> 13:07.026
You still married her to Jiangnan.
[♪Jiangnan: regions south of the Yangtze River]

13:07.050 --> 13:08.050
Mm.

13:08.700 --> 13:09.700
Only in this way

13:09.825 --> 13:11.050
could you get support

13:11.090 --> 13:12.350
from scholars in Jiangnan.

13:12.900 --> 13:13.900
Yes.

13:14.575 --> 13:15.547
My second eldest sister came back,

13:15.571 --> 13:16.775
but only saw me once.

13:17.225 --> 13:18.186
You didn't keep her.

13:18.210 --> 13:19.210
I didn't.

13:19.825 --> 13:21.346
You made her study
in Shangyin Academy

13:21.370 --> 13:22.770
so that scholars all over the world

13:22.850 --> 13:24.425
would gradually accept North Liang.

13:24.800 --> 13:25.800
Exactly.

13:28.350 --> 13:30.200
Now, you've sent Huangman'er away, too.

13:31.850 --> 13:33.466
You sent my siblings away,

13:33.490 --> 13:35.075
in exchange for stable power.

13:35.400 --> 13:36.840
Formidable enemies want to fight us.

13:37.800 --> 13:39.010
The royal family fears us.

13:39.325 --> 13:41.025
For the survival of North Liang,

13:41.275 --> 13:43.175
we have to pay some price.

13:48.775 --> 13:50.200
So, in your heart,

13:50.600 --> 13:52.920
our family isn't as important
as the throne of North Liang.

13:58.425 --> 14:00.000
We're arriving soon.

14:08.325 --> 14:11.045
Formless yet complete?

14:11.810 --> 14:12.427
Run away!

14:12.451 --> 14:13.611
Some people want to kill you.

14:14.010 --> 14:14.706
Who?

14:14.730 --> 14:15.627
They're disguised as servants.

14:15.651 --> 14:16.726
I saw them hold blades

14:16.750 --> 14:18.110
and head for your room.

14:18.650 --> 14:20.275
Not everybody dares to break

14:20.490 --> 14:22.100
into the house of His Highness.

14:22.475 --> 14:23.226
I'll stop them.

14:23.250 --> 14:24.250
Leave through the window.

14:25.675 --> 14:27.350
If Miss Weixiong wanted to kill you,

14:29.025 --> 14:31.075
she wouldn't ask her subordinates
to do that.

14:32.700 --> 14:33.700
I know.

14:34.450 --> 14:35.387
I stopped them

14:35.411 --> 14:36.450
for you.

14:37.170 --> 14:38.975
I've confiscated their blades, too.

14:39.450 --> 14:40.786
Why do servants

14:40.810 --> 14:42.810
dare to kill people?

14:43.850 --> 14:45.800
Servants in the house of Miss Weixiong

14:46.010 --> 14:47.800
used to be bandits
convicted of grave crimes.

14:48.010 --> 14:50.125
Why do they work in the Mansion?

14:50.530 --> 14:52.300
Miss Weixiong caught them.

14:53.330 --> 14:54.466
Since little,

14:54.490 --> 14:55.770
Miss Weixiong has loved to kill.

14:55.930 --> 14:58.475
She has exterminated
countless bandits out of the town.

14:58.730 --> 15:00.400
Many people sighed

15:01.570 --> 15:03.090
it was a pity

15:03.350 --> 15:04.650
that Xu Weixiong wasn't a man.

15:23.925 --> 15:26.426
(Zhao Kai, student in Shangyin Academy)

15:26.450 --> 15:27.450
You're back?

15:29.050 --> 15:30.226
You seldom go back home.

15:30.250 --> 15:31.726
Why didn't you stay at home
for a few more days?

15:31.750 --> 15:33.270
How's everything going in your family?

15:36.925 --> 15:38.300
Who gave it to you?

15:39.930 --> 15:41.800
Why didn't you accept what I gave you?

15:46.850 --> 15:47.850
Next time,

15:48.770 --> 15:50.325
let me go to North Liang with you.

15:52.275 --> 15:53.930
I want to accompany you and protect you.

15:56.425 --> 15:57.425
Wait.

16:00.075 --> 16:01.150
See you in class.

16:13.961 --> 16:18.009
(Shangyin Academy)

16:45.350 --> 16:46.410
Are your legs all right?

16:46.525 --> 16:48.625
We've reached the bottom of the lake.

16:49.000 --> 16:50.775
It's quite damp here.

16:51.275 --> 16:52.410
But I'm all right.

16:57.050 --> 16:58.600
What's hiding down there?

16:59.400 --> 17:01.050
You'll see it yourself.

17:59.575 --> 18:01.076
(Tablet of General Zhao Changling,
of the 18th Battalion of Jinzhou)

18:01.100 --> 18:02.551
(Tablet of General Chen Qiong,
of the 18th Battalion of Jinzhou)

18:02.575 --> 18:05.055
(Tablet of General Wang Jian,
of the 18th Battalion of Jinzhou)

18:08.600 --> 18:09.890
Chen Zhibao's father...

18:15.600 --> 18:16.970
In the Battle of Jinliao,

18:20.225 --> 18:21.350
he died

18:21.850 --> 18:22.875
to save my life.

18:25.400 --> 18:26.450
Otherwise,

18:27.950 --> 18:29.370
he would have been

18:29.800 --> 18:30.826
the Lord of North Liang.

18:30.850 --> 18:33.370
(Tablet of General Chen Qiong,
of the 18th Battalion of Jinzhou)

18:36.175 --> 18:37.325
Everybody

18:37.700 --> 18:38.587
asked me

18:38.611 --> 18:40.011
to be on the watch for Chen Zhibao.

18:40.550 --> 18:41.610
But I know

18:42.950 --> 18:43.950
what North Liang means

18:45.550 --> 18:47.600
to him.

18:49.325 --> 18:50.350
Wang Jian.

18:50.775 --> 18:52.575
(Tablet of Wang Jian)
When Yique was defeated,

18:52.875 --> 18:54.300
he used his hands

18:54.650 --> 18:56.050
to hold up the city gate

18:56.625 --> 18:57.890
so that I could run away.

18:58.800 --> 18:59.825
But he...

19:00.350 --> 19:02.500
He was crumbled.

19:06.275 --> 19:07.275
Look.

19:09.425 --> 19:10.975
In the Battle against West Chu,

19:11.500 --> 19:12.666
we were

19:12.690 --> 19:15.106
ten li away from the capital city.
[♪li: unit of length, equals 500 meters.]

19:15.130 --> 19:16.201
(Tablet of Zhao Changling)
Our counselor,

19:16.225 --> 19:18.105
(Tablet of Zhao Changling)
Zhao Changling, died.

19:18.570 --> 19:19.750
If he walked ten li farther,

19:20.200 --> 19:21.067
he would have

19:21.091 --> 19:24.375
taken revenge for his whole family.

19:34.100 --> 19:35.875
This man was gruff-voiced.

19:36.125 --> 19:37.825
But he loved to sing.

19:39.475 --> 19:40.490
Fan Li.

19:42.800 --> 19:43.800
He died...

19:43.975 --> 19:45.970
He died too young.

20:05.100 --> 20:06.100
Han Li.

20:07.900 --> 20:09.225
He didn't commit a capital crime.

20:09.525 --> 20:11.125
But to consolidate military disciplines,

20:11.350 --> 20:12.475
I chopped off

20:13.075 --> 20:14.975
his head personally.

20:28.500 --> 20:29.586
At that time,

20:29.610 --> 20:31.950
I started with 600 cavalrymen.

20:32.350 --> 20:33.425
Now,

20:33.930 --> 20:35.350
all nations are in peace.

20:36.090 --> 20:37.400
Our army

20:37.850 --> 20:39.550
rules three states.

20:40.325 --> 20:42.125
But nearly all the 600 cavalrymen

20:43.575 --> 20:45.350
are here.

20:56.350 --> 20:57.910
Why are there no sacrificial offerings?

20:59.150 --> 21:00.150
No need.

21:00.900 --> 21:02.400
They don't need such things.

21:03.375 --> 21:04.375
Son,

21:06.600 --> 21:07.875
do you know

21:08.400 --> 21:10.346
why I'm known

21:10.370 --> 21:11.370
as Slayer?

21:13.875 --> 21:14.676
Because you've killed too many people.

21:14.700 --> 21:15.700
Right.

21:17.325 --> 21:18.825
There were many wars between nations.

21:19.475 --> 21:20.801
I've killed

21:20.825 --> 21:23.225
quite a lot of people
from aristocratic families.

21:23.610 --> 21:25.530
So, everybody hates me

21:25.900 --> 21:27.050
and treats me as a demon.

21:32.900 --> 21:33.950
At present,

21:34.750 --> 21:37.050
in Liyang,

21:38.850 --> 21:40.490
the imperial examination system is used.

21:43.025 --> 21:44.626
For people all over the world,

21:44.650 --> 21:46.800
rich or poor,

21:47.150 --> 21:48.450
there's hope.

21:50.375 --> 21:51.850
If aristocratic families

21:52.325 --> 21:54.375
hadn't been eliminated,

21:54.650 --> 21:55.552
believe it or not,

21:55.576 --> 21:59.570
officials would still
be recommended by them.

22:03.250 --> 22:04.107
Think...

22:04.131 --> 22:05.725
Think of the world

22:06.550 --> 22:08.525
as a big tree.

22:09.400 --> 22:11.250
Aristocratic families

22:11.550 --> 22:12.550
turn out

22:13.125 --> 22:15.350
to be strong branches.

22:15.825 --> 22:18.125
They absorb all the sunlight.

22:20.100 --> 22:21.800
The remaining majority of people

22:22.350 --> 22:25.210
are like weeds under the tree

22:25.875 --> 22:29.075
which will gradually wither and rot.

22:30.125 --> 22:31.125
So,

22:32.575 --> 22:34.300
there can't be a new life

22:35.200 --> 22:37.475
unless aristocratic families
are eliminated.

22:40.150 --> 22:41.170
This is...

22:41.450 --> 22:44.075
This is their dream.

22:44.600 --> 22:45.725
It's my dream, too.

22:55.475 --> 22:57.186
Your eldest sister
was married to Jiangnan.

22:57.210 --> 22:58.210
Your second eldest sister

22:59.050 --> 23:00.346
went to Shangyin Academy.

23:00.370 --> 23:02.010
They did that voluntarily.

23:02.475 --> 23:04.970
They would rather sacrifice their lives

23:05.010 --> 23:08.090
to lay a foundation for North Liang.

23:10.175 --> 23:11.586
For the sake of the dead cavalrymen?

23:11.610 --> 23:12.610
No.

23:13.525 --> 23:14.610
Only for you.

23:15.450 --> 23:16.170
For me?

23:16.200 --> 23:17.676
They want to shelter you from trouble

23:17.700 --> 23:18.700
so that

23:18.800 --> 23:21.010
you can take over North Liang smoothly.

23:25.050 --> 23:26.675
Have you thought about it?

23:27.475 --> 23:28.500
I hate

23:29.250 --> 23:30.776
aristocratic families so much.

23:30.800 --> 23:31.387
But why do I

23:31.411 --> 23:33.610
still want our family
to rule North Liang?

23:34.825 --> 23:35.825
Why?

23:38.700 --> 23:41.050
The royal family treats us
as a formidable enemy.

23:41.675 --> 23:43.175
In our army,

23:43.375 --> 23:44.770
there are many factions.

23:45.475 --> 23:47.466
If we no longer rule North Liang,

23:47.490 --> 23:49.576
our army with 350 thousand soldiers

23:49.600 --> 23:51.090
will cause chaos.

23:51.690 --> 23:53.475
The peaceful world,

23:54.175 --> 23:55.900
which so many people died for,

23:56.850 --> 23:57.850
will be ruined.

24:09.075 --> 24:10.930
Why didn't you tell me before?

24:14.425 --> 24:17.170
Until you want to take over North Liang,

24:17.700 --> 24:19.730
I couldn't bring you here.

24:20.225 --> 24:21.225
Nor could I

24:21.525 --> 24:23.130
explain to you.

24:25.550 --> 24:27.050
I kind of understand.

24:29.825 --> 24:31.450
You're not greedy for power.

24:33.900 --> 24:35.220
Our families have been sacrificed

24:35.825 --> 24:36.825
for the dream

24:36.850 --> 24:38.750
these people are after.

24:39.900 --> 24:41.900
This is the responsibility
Weixiong told me.

24:42.575 --> 24:44.746
This is the real reason

24:44.770 --> 24:46.275
why you must take over North Liang.

25:46.475 --> 25:48.451
(Tablet of General Peng Wanli,
of the 18th Battalion of Jinzhou)

25:48.475 --> 25:50.451
(Tablet of General Han Li,
of the 18th Battalion of Jinzhou)

25:50.475 --> 25:52.351
(Tablet of General Zhang Hanfu,
of the 18th Battalion of Jinzhou)

25:52.375 --> 25:54.935
(Tablet of General Zhou Tujing,
of the 18th Battalion of Jinzhou)

26:17.425 --> 26:18.475
I disagree.

26:19.825 --> 26:21.146
It's a very good dream

26:21.170 --> 26:22.475
to seek peace for people

26:23.025 --> 26:24.400
and stop wars for the world.

26:24.700 --> 26:26.475
But I disagree with your methods.

26:27.175 --> 26:29.450
When you rule
by killing and playing tricks,

26:29.925 --> 26:31.770
do they still want such a North Liang?

26:31.975 --> 26:34.050
Don't be naive, will you?

26:34.875 --> 26:36.550
Without killing,

26:36.750 --> 26:38.450
how could we protect North Liang?

26:38.700 --> 26:39.786
Isn't it too hard?

26:39.810 --> 26:41.370
However hard it is,
we can't compromise.

26:42.150 --> 26:43.370
I will take over North Liang,

26:43.750 --> 26:45.090
but I will not go your way.

26:46.650 --> 26:47.950
I will defend our dream,

26:48.525 --> 26:49.805
and I'll protect my family, too.

26:51.575 --> 26:52.815
Can there be a perfect solution

26:53.150 --> 26:54.270
for everything in the world?

26:54.950 --> 26:56.875
Without a cruel heart,

26:57.050 --> 26:58.375
you couldn't defend anything.

26:58.675 --> 26:59.675
I want to give it a try.

27:04.025 --> 27:05.025
Fine.

27:05.275 --> 27:06.290
I'll give you a chance

27:06.875 --> 27:08.970
to confront the reality.

27:44.475 --> 27:45.850
Who opened the passageway?

27:47.290 --> 27:48.290
His Lordship.

27:53.625 --> 27:54.625
Oh.

27:56.700 --> 27:57.775
No problem, then.

28:04.350 --> 28:05.650
About the passageway,

28:06.500 --> 28:07.700
please do not

28:08.500 --> 28:09.700
tell anyone else.

28:10.675 --> 28:11.675
I see.

28:12.125 --> 28:13.125
Mm.

28:13.500 --> 28:15.160
I'll keep the secret for them.

28:21.850 --> 28:22.850
Them?

28:23.075 --> 28:23.690
Wait.

28:23.975 --> 28:25.050
Who else went down?

28:27.650 --> 28:28.675
Xu Fengnian.

28:29.525 --> 28:30.525
Oh.

28:34.650 --> 28:36.400
I have to get packed.

28:38.250 --> 28:39.690
We'll have a long journey.

28:49.350 --> 28:50.650
You want me to leave Lingzhou?

28:51.200 --> 28:52.200
Where shall I go?

28:52.575 --> 28:54.950
Didn't you say you would go to Wudi City

28:55.600 --> 28:56.626
and get back the sword box

28:56.650 --> 28:59.050
for Old Huang?

28:59.225 --> 29:00.906
I only keep 60% to 70% of Dahuangting.

29:00.930 --> 29:02.146
I can't defeat Wang Xianzhi for now.

29:02.170 --> 29:03.386
You don't need to fight him

29:03.410 --> 29:05.450
to get the sword box back.

29:05.525 --> 29:06.525
Besides,

29:07.025 --> 29:11.066
this is the route you must take
before you take over North Liang.

29:11.090 --> 29:13.386
What does a trip to the martial world

29:13.410 --> 29:14.626
have to do with taking over North Liang?

29:14.650 --> 29:15.650
After the New Year,

29:15.875 --> 29:17.235
you're going to the martial world.

29:17.325 --> 29:18.746
I'm going to the capital city.

29:18.770 --> 29:20.450
We'll leave together.

29:20.600 --> 29:22.090
You're going to the capital city?

29:22.525 --> 29:23.996
The biggest hurdle

29:24.020 --> 29:25.176
for your taking over North Liang

29:25.200 --> 29:26.900
lies in the court.

29:27.250 --> 29:28.400
The throne of North Liang

29:28.650 --> 29:30.326
should be hereditary.

29:30.350 --> 29:33.251
But the court wanted
to abolish it long ago.

29:33.275 --> 29:36.325
By then, North Liang
will fall into chaos.

29:36.600 --> 29:39.876
I must get the throne for you

29:39.900 --> 29:41.810
so that we can gain the upper hand.

29:42.525 --> 29:44.051
The royal family isn't foolish.

29:44.075 --> 29:45.850
How will they let me take the throne?

29:46.225 --> 29:48.330
I'll have everything arranged for you.

29:49.175 --> 29:49.907
By the way,

29:49.931 --> 29:52.125
you miss your sisters and brother,
don't you?

29:52.375 --> 29:54.250
You'll have the chance

29:54.400 --> 29:55.666
to meet your eldest sister

29:55.690 --> 29:56.370
and second eldest sister.

29:56.425 --> 29:58.925
You can also visit Mount Longhu.

30:00.775 --> 30:02.300
What exactly are you up to?

30:02.600 --> 30:04.690
I'll make a deal with the court.

30:05.450 --> 30:07.926
I'll get your sisters home

30:07.950 --> 30:10.066
and cancel my arrangements

30:10.090 --> 30:10.787
in Jiangnan and Shangyin Academy,

30:10.811 --> 30:12.226
just to keep the chance

30:12.250 --> 30:14.330
for your hereditary throne.

30:16.375 --> 30:18.930
You mean I can get sisters back?

30:21.075 --> 30:23.100
I'll have everything arranged for you.

30:23.275 --> 30:24.350
What you have to do

30:24.400 --> 30:26.450
is to make the final choice,

30:26.775 --> 30:29.100
like you did on Mount Wudang.

30:30.800 --> 30:31.747
What choice?

30:31.771 --> 30:34.125
You'll decide how to get them back.

30:35.725 --> 30:36.810
Fengnian,

30:37.700 --> 30:39.650
if many people have to die

30:39.925 --> 30:41.570
during the process

30:41.925 --> 30:43.770
before you get them back home,

30:44.625 --> 30:45.625
what will you do?

30:47.225 --> 30:49.050
I'll come up with the third option.

30:50.625 --> 30:53.250
Not many people are like Old Huang.

30:53.600 --> 30:56.410
People always come up
with destructive options.

30:57.675 --> 30:59.115
Where there's a will, there's a way.

31:02.325 --> 31:03.010
Good.

31:03.325 --> 31:04.450
I'll wait and see.

31:04.900 --> 31:06.450
I'll wait and see.

31:09.225 --> 31:10.490
Go up there alone.

31:11.100 --> 31:13.210
I'd like to stay with them
for a bit longer.

31:32.925 --> 31:33.802
You...

31:33.826 --> 31:35.085
You heard him, didn't you?

31:39.350 --> 31:40.770
Think about it.

31:41.800 --> 31:43.370
What kind of father am I?

31:43.650 --> 31:44.650
What kind?

31:49.100 --> 31:50.490
But I...

31:51.050 --> 31:52.370
I really believe that

31:53.375 --> 31:54.666
only when he has to

31:54.690 --> 31:55.866
make a choice in the most difficult time

31:55.890 --> 31:58.090
will he no longer be naive

31:58.290 --> 31:59.290
and will he

31:59.900 --> 32:01.075
grow up.

32:03.325 --> 32:04.325
Right?

32:06.550 --> 32:07.550
Right?

32:13.275 --> 32:14.275
Fine.

32:16.325 --> 32:17.770
Rest assured.

32:18.925 --> 32:20.450
I will make Fengnian

32:21.300 --> 32:25.090
a qualified lord of North Liang

32:25.575 --> 32:27.750
so that he will defend the world

32:28.075 --> 32:29.490
for you

32:30.130 --> 32:31.810
and for me!

32:40.750 --> 32:42.151
(Tablet of General Zhao Changling,
of the 18th Battalion of Jinzhou)

32:42.175 --> 32:43.626
(Tablet of General Chen Qiong,
of the 18th Battalion of Jinzhou)

32:43.650 --> 32:46.130
(Tablet of General Wang Jian,
of the 18th Battalion of Jinzhou)

33:29.010 --> 33:31.300
You must have heard us.

33:33.025 --> 33:34.400
My son

33:35.090 --> 33:36.610
insists on going to Wudi City,

33:37.000 --> 33:40.175
to get back the sword box for Old Huang.

33:40.850 --> 33:41.850
Childish.

33:45.300 --> 33:47.050
But his trip

33:47.610 --> 33:49.875
will certainly be very dangerous.

33:51.690 --> 33:53.575
Someone should keep him company

33:53.690 --> 33:54.690
and protect his life.

34:13.800 --> 34:15.386
Even if he manages

34:15.410 --> 34:17.930
to arrive in Wudi City safe and sound,

34:18.375 --> 34:20.506
when he meets Wang Xianzhi,

34:20.530 --> 34:22.050
it's hard to tell if he'll still live.

34:24.175 --> 34:27.410
I heard that Wang Xianzhi has greatly
improved his martial arts.

34:28.690 --> 34:30.025
That's awesome.

34:31.225 --> 34:33.425
If Fengnian acts on impulse

34:34.225 --> 34:35.970
and fights Wang Xianzhi,

34:36.400 --> 34:39.410
he'll be dead.

34:40.850 --> 34:42.330
Think about Wang Xianzhi.

34:44.800 --> 34:46.970
Why does he kill everybody he meets?

34:56.125 --> 34:56.876
My Lord.

34:56.900 --> 34:57.900
Mm.

35:01.000 --> 35:03.010
Where are you going?

35:04.575 --> 35:06.095
Now that His Highness went down there,

35:06.150 --> 35:07.770
I guess we're leaving soon.

35:09.575 --> 35:11.825
You're indeed experienced.

35:13.275 --> 35:14.515
He'll leave after the New Year.

35:15.525 --> 35:16.730
During the trip,

35:18.275 --> 35:19.810
please take good care of him.

35:20.375 --> 35:21.375
Oh.

35:21.775 --> 35:22.810
I will.

35:23.600 --> 35:24.600
What are you doing?

35:34.050 --> 35:35.090
Put it back.

36:04.900 --> 36:06.530
I'm leaving in a couple of days.

36:06.675 --> 36:07.970
You don't need to pack now.

36:08.825 --> 36:10.146
I need to pack carefully

36:10.170 --> 36:11.450
for your trip.

36:13.900 --> 36:15.000
Shall I read it or not?

36:16.900 --> 36:17.970
Not for today.

36:18.000 --> 36:19.050
You lied to me.

36:20.425 --> 36:21.706
Visit someone with me tomorrow.

36:21.730 --> 36:22.890
I'll pay you.

36:23.000 --> 36:24.000
How much?

36:25.775 --> 36:26.855
This is half of the amount.

36:31.375 --> 36:32.826
Prepare some presents for me.

36:32.850 --> 36:33.930
Take them with us tomorrow.

36:34.900 --> 36:36.225
Tomorrow is New Year's Eve.

36:36.330 --> 36:37.946
Everybody will be staying
with his family.

36:37.970 --> 36:38.986
If you want to visit someone,

36:39.010 --> 36:40.890
you'd better go
after the first day of New Year.

36:41.925 --> 36:43.850
Not everybody has a family.

36:51.050 --> 36:52.551
(Pastry, Pancakes)

36:52.575 --> 36:53.775
It's crooked.

36:55.500 --> 36:56.610
Xu?

36:57.075 --> 36:58.875
Put it straight for me.

37:00.000 --> 37:01.000
Ouch.

37:01.175 --> 37:02.175
Ouch.

37:02.450 --> 37:03.450
Oh, no.

37:05.600 --> 37:06.600
Be seated.

37:06.875 --> 37:07.875
Bring the presents in.

37:10.100 --> 37:11.250
Put them on the table.

37:11.290 --> 37:12.226
Light the stove.

37:12.250 --> 37:13.250
Oh.

37:13.825 --> 37:15.175
But I can't light a stove.

37:16.800 --> 37:18.075
Still that girl?

37:19.275 --> 37:20.275
Have you

37:20.550 --> 37:21.601
got married yet?

37:21.625 --> 37:22.427
No.

37:22.451 --> 37:24.666
We're not a couple.

37:24.690 --> 37:25.866
I've brought some food for you.

37:25.890 --> 37:27.090
Hope you'll like it.

37:27.475 --> 37:28.576
Thank you.

37:28.600 --> 37:30.186
But didn't I tell you?

37:30.210 --> 37:31.850
Before every New Year,

37:32.200 --> 37:35.201
the government has a lot of food
delivered to me.

37:35.225 --> 37:36.546
I can't finish it.

37:36.570 --> 37:37.750
Keep it, then.

37:38.025 --> 37:39.626
The deliveryman from the government

37:39.650 --> 37:41.250
said the same thing.

37:44.400 --> 37:45.351
Old Xu.

37:45.375 --> 37:46.375
What?

37:47.170 --> 37:49.076
I heard you worked for Xu Xiao
for many years.

37:49.100 --> 37:50.626
You can't call him by his name.

37:50.650 --> 37:51.386
Right. Right.

37:51.410 --> 37:52.346
General Xu.

37:52.370 --> 37:53.226
Grand Commander.

37:53.250 --> 37:54.250
Yes.

37:54.875 --> 37:55.787
Do you remember

37:55.811 --> 37:57.300
why you started to work for him?

37:57.750 --> 37:58.890
At first,

37:59.330 --> 38:01.250
I worked for him to make a living.

38:02.875 --> 38:04.075
I expected

38:04.775 --> 38:05.925
the peace of the world

38:06.375 --> 38:08.275
and the justice in the world.

38:08.675 --> 38:10.170
There's no such thing as justice.

38:11.330 --> 38:12.475
Don't say that.

38:13.000 --> 38:14.330
This spring,

38:14.650 --> 38:15.925
a student

38:16.090 --> 38:17.400
from a poor family

38:17.575 --> 38:19.455
passed the imperial examination,
didn't he?

38:20.150 --> 38:21.466
But those who passed
the imperial examination

38:21.490 --> 38:22.770
are mostly from rich families.

38:23.370 --> 38:24.925
That's enough.

38:25.810 --> 38:28.050
God bless North Liang, I hope,

38:28.530 --> 38:30.375
so that we can keep

38:30.690 --> 38:32.350
the peace of the world.

38:35.570 --> 38:36.570
I will

38:37.375 --> 38:38.625
maintain the peace for you.

38:40.975 --> 38:41.975
Xu,

38:42.500 --> 38:44.025
are you drunk

38:44.375 --> 38:45.950
with too much Tusu Wine?

38:55.250 --> 38:57.370
What do you think
if I become the Lord of North Liang?

38:57.775 --> 38:59.850
You think you're better
than Chen Zhibao?

39:01.100 --> 39:02.027
Actually, I thought about

39:02.051 --> 39:03.691
letting Chen Zhibao
take over North Liang.

39:04.300 --> 39:05.750
But now I understand.

39:06.325 --> 39:07.325
He can't do that.

39:07.775 --> 39:08.775
Why?

39:09.425 --> 39:11.325
He looks calm.

39:11.525 --> 39:12.786
But deep in his heart,

39:12.810 --> 39:14.275
he's seething with hatred.

39:14.575 --> 39:15.930
He's got something in his mind.

39:16.900 --> 39:18.426
If he takes over North Liang,

39:18.450 --> 39:19.875
wars will resume.

39:20.325 --> 39:22.186
The peaceful world Old Xu and others
have been fighting for

39:22.210 --> 39:23.325
will be ruined.

39:24.130 --> 39:26.290
You sound
as if you could keep the peace.

39:30.975 --> 39:31.975
What?

39:32.550 --> 39:33.346
It's the New Year.

39:33.370 --> 39:34.370
A present for you.

39:35.200 --> 39:36.826
You're the son of the Lord.

39:36.850 --> 39:38.400
But you only gave me a string?

39:38.725 --> 39:40.200
Expensive presents don't suit you.

39:40.970 --> 39:42.050
They do.

39:43.400 --> 39:45.000
Give it back to me if you don't want it.

39:45.375 --> 39:46.375
Why do I not want it?

39:46.550 --> 39:47.507
When I sell it,

39:47.531 --> 39:49.370
maybe I'll make a coin.

40:02.250 --> 40:04.450
You're Miss Fan beside Mr. Lin,

40:04.925 --> 40:06.130
aren't you?

40:07.425 --> 40:08.925
Xu Xiao released you?

40:10.125 --> 40:11.376
For your information, Your Highness,

40:11.400 --> 40:12.570
I'm Shu Xiu.

40:12.900 --> 40:15.090
Shu for comfortable and Xiu for shy.

40:15.350 --> 40:16.350
It's a friendly name.

40:18.525 --> 40:20.170
Miss Fan is an alias?

40:32.100 --> 40:33.570
It's cautious of you, Your Highness.

40:33.700 --> 40:34.450
Don't worry.

40:34.550 --> 40:35.550
It's nontoxic.

40:36.825 --> 40:40.125
His Lordship said
you always wanted perfect solutions.

40:40.775 --> 40:42.066
After Ning Emei was back,

40:42.090 --> 40:43.370
he was locked up in the dungeon.

40:43.800 --> 40:45.425
He should have been executed.

40:45.975 --> 40:47.525
Now that you want a perfect solution,

40:47.775 --> 40:49.425
you will decide

40:49.570 --> 40:50.925
whether he lives or dies.

41:06.930 --> 41:08.450
You're indeed cautious, Your Highness.

41:09.475 --> 41:10.475
By the way,

41:10.775 --> 41:12.100
I'd like to remind you.

41:12.675 --> 41:14.915
You didn't bring back
Young Master Longxiang from Wudang.

41:15.300 --> 41:17.730
Ning Emei complained about that.

41:42.250 --> 41:44.010
You didn't bring back
Young Master Longxiang?

41:46.075 --> 41:47.450
He was sent to Mount Longhu.

41:47.750 --> 41:48.825
Mount Longhu?

41:49.650 --> 41:50.786
It means he's been delivered
into the hand of the royal family.

41:50.810 --> 41:52.100
No matter what I've done,

41:53.025 --> 41:54.200
I don't care

41:54.475 --> 41:55.525
whether you believe me

41:55.875 --> 41:56.875
or not.

41:57.675 --> 41:58.900
The point is...

41:59.730 --> 42:01.250
Do you want to see Huangman'er?

42:01.750 --> 42:03.466
He's been sent to Mount Longhu.

42:03.490 --> 42:04.490
How can I see him again?

42:05.250 --> 42:06.730
I'll go on a trip after the New Year.

42:07.075 --> 42:08.350
I'll pass through Mount Longhu.

42:10.450 --> 42:11.610
Would you like to go with me?

42:15.570 --> 42:16.570
Yes.

42:17.050 --> 42:19.150
I'll get Young Master Longxiang
back to North Liang.

42:29.475 --> 42:30.675
Go back home for recuperation.

42:31.100 --> 42:32.420
We're leaving after the New Year.

42:39.350 --> 42:41.001
Xu Xiao keeps saying

42:41.025 --> 42:42.945
that we shouldn't forget
the dead 600 cavalrymen.

42:44.075 --> 42:45.401
But every day,

42:45.425 --> 42:48.290
he only cares for factional struggles.

42:49.625 --> 42:51.275
Even I feel sorry for Old Xu.

43:29.875 --> 43:32.650
♪ The flower of pain ♪

43:34.425 --> 43:37.225
♪ Blooms in my heart ♪

43:39.150 --> 43:42.070
♪ I made a bet with the dawn ♪

43:43.150 --> 43:46.950
♪ That you'll answer ♪

43:48.250 --> 43:51.150
♪ Forgive this tragic end ♪

43:52.850 --> 43:55.670
♪ Moved by the moment we met ♪

43:57.675 --> 44:00.430
♪ In spite of thunder and lightning ♪

44:01.450 --> 44:05.375
♪ In spite of my falling ♪

44:05.875 --> 44:08.606
♪ When we are apart ♪

44:08.630 --> 44:09.870
♪ I'll collapse ♪

44:10.650 --> 44:14.510
♪ Capture an image of the memory ♪

44:15.325 --> 44:18.051
♪ After all these ups and downs ♪

44:18.075 --> 44:19.510
♪ The vanity ♪

44:20.000 --> 44:23.875
♪ Who will open it again ♪

44:24.300 --> 44:25.651
♪ It's worth it ♪

44:25.675 --> 44:28.510
♪ It's enough ♪

44:28.925 --> 44:31.406
♪ Drowned in sadness ♪

44:31.430 --> 44:33.830
♪ Just to see through ♪

44:34.125 --> 44:36.151
♪ I will whisper love to you ♪

44:36.175 --> 44:38.351
♪ For a lifetime ♪

44:38.375 --> 44:42.590
♪ End the worry in the world ♪

44:42.950 --> 44:44.086
♪ It's worth it ♪

44:44.110 --> 44:47.150
♪ I'll be there for you all my life ♪

44:47.325 --> 44:49.286
♪ After the moments of beauty ♪

44:49.310 --> 44:52.030
♪ You are my reason to be ♪

44:52.590 --> 44:54.406
♪ If there is a way ♪

44:54.430 --> 44:56.926
♪ To start over ♪

44:56.950 --> 45:01.050
♪ Will you still remember me ♪
